<title>USA: Resource Mortgage approves 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Resource Mortgage approves 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>GLEN ALLEN, Va. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resource Mortgage Capital said its board has authorized a two-for-one stock split to shareholders of record May 5.</p>
<p>The stock split must be approved by shareholders before becoming effective.</p>
<p>&quot;The common stock price has climbed from an initial offering price of $10 per share in February 1988 to its current price of $29.75 per share, an increase of nearly 200 percent. We feel the stock split will make the stock more affordable for investors and will create a more liquid market for the shares,&quot; said company president Thomas Potts.</p>
</text>
